        "Support our cause\n\nPaying directly to our bank account; or\nsetting up either a one-off or a recurring payment via PayPal.\n\nPlease consider setting a recurring payment as every month is a struggle to make ends meet.\n\nPlease Note: Currently, we are unable to provide a tax-deductible receipt.\n\nPlease consider supporting our efforts.\n\nAmount USD EUR GBP CHF AUD HKD CAD JPY NZD SGD SEK DKK PLN NOK HUF CZK ILS MXN\n\nOR\n\nFor all custom donations\n\nThe below details ensure we can allocate your donation as per your wishes.\n\nOnce submitted bank account details will be displayed and emailed to you immediately.",
